  "content_id": "16136179",
  "title": "Simplex Transactions Issues",
  "description": "Why Was My Simplex Transaction Declined?\nIf your transaction via Simplex didn’t go through, it may be due to security filters, payment iss...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why Was My Simplex Transaction Declined?</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\">If your transaction via Simplex didn’t go through, it may be due to security filters, payment issues, or verification problems.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Common Reasons</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Payment Issues:</b> Insufficient funds, incorrect card details, or no 3D Secure</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Verification Incomplete:</b> Missing ID or payment method confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Bank Restrictions:</b> Crypto purchases may be blocked or marked as cash advances</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Security Flag:</b> Fraud detection system may auto-decline suspicious activity</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Recommended Actions</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Double-check card details and verification status</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Try another payment method</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Contact your bank</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Check your email (including spam) for Simplex verification requests</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://www.simplex.com/SUPPORT\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"><b>Contact Simplex Support</b></a><b>: https://www.simplex.com/SUPPORT</b></p></li></ol>",
  "author_id": 9849332,
